{"seq":3,"slug":"host-bindings-interop","title":"主机绑定与互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/runtime-execution/host-bindings-interop","wordCount":1238,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"主机绑定与互操作\">主机绑定与互操作</h1><p>Wasm 的算力再强，也要能把结果交还给宿主、把宿主的数据喂进来才有意义。可问题在于：Wasm 函数签名只认 <a href=\"../wasm-foundations/linear-memory-types\">线性内存与类型系统</a> 里那几种标量与引用，而宿主世界里满是字符串、对象、数组、回调。这一篇讲的就是这条边界上的工程——主机绑定（host bindings）如何让 Wasm 与 JavaScript（浏览器/Node）或原生宿主（嵌入式运行时）互相调用、互传数据，以及为什么这条边界的开销值得认真对待。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>互操作的本质是「跨越一道类型与内存的鸿沟」。Wasm 侧有自己的线性内存与标量类型，宿主侧有自己的对象堆。每次跨边界，数据要么被编码进共享的线性内存，要么以不透明句柄（<code>externref</code>）传递。绑定层的职责就是自动生成这套编解码。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  HOST[&quot;宿主侧 (JS 对象 / 原生数据)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;调用导出函数&quot;| BIND[&quot;绑定层&lt;br/&gt;编码参数&quot;]&#10;  BIND --&gt; ENC{&quot;参数类型&quot;}&#10;  ENC --&gt;|&quot;标量&quot;| DIRECT[&quot;直接传值&quot;]&#10;  ENC --&gt;|&quot;字符串/数组&quot;| MEM[&quot;写入线性内存, 传指针+长度&quot;]&#10;  ENC --&gt;|&quot;宿主对象&quot;| REF[&quot;externref 句柄&quot;]&#10;  MEM --&gt; WASM[&quot;Wasm 函数执行&quot;]&#10;  DIRECT --&gt; WASM&#10;  REF --&gt; WASM&#10;  WASM --&gt;|&quot;返回&quot;| DECODE[&quot;绑定层解码结果&quot;]&#10;  DECODE --&gt; HOST\">flowchart TD\n  HOST[\"宿主侧 (JS 对象 / 原生数据)\"] --&gt;|\"调用导出函数\"| BIND[\"绑定层&lt;br/&gt;编码参数\"]\n  BIND --&gt; ENC{\"参数类型\"}\n  ENC --&gt;|\"标量\"| DIRECT[\"直接传值\"]\n  ENC --&gt;|\"字符串/数组\"| MEM[\"写入线性内存, 传指针+长度\"]\n  ENC --&gt;|\"宿主对象\"| REF[\"externref 句柄\"]\n  MEM --&gt; WASM[\"Wasm 函数执行\"]\n  DIRECT --&gt; WASM\n  REF --&gt; WASM\n  WASM --&gt;|\"返回\"| DECODE[\"绑定层解码结果\"]\n  DECODE --&gt; HOST</pre><p>下表对照几类数据如何跨边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据</th>\n<th>传递方式</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整数/浮点</td>\n<td>直接作为标量参数</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字符串</td>\n<td>写入线性内存，传 (指针, 长度)</td>\n<td>中（需拷贝+编解码）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字节数组</td>\n<td>同上，或零拷贝视图</td>\n<td>中/低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宿主对象（DOM 节点）</td>\n<td><code>externref</code> 不透明句柄</td>\n<td>低（仅传句柄）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回调函数</td>\n<td>表中的 <code>funcref</code> + <code>call_indirect</code></td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"javascript-互操作-webassembly-api\">JavaScript 互操作：WebAssembly API</h2><p>在浏览器与 Node 中，宿主就是 JS 引擎，互操作通过标准的 <code>WebAssembly</code> JS API 完成。加载与实例化一个模块、提供导入、调用导出，最小骨架如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const importObject = {&#10;  env: {&#10;    // 把宿主能力以导入函数注入模块&#10;    log: (ptr, len) =&gt; {&#10;      const bytes = new Uint8Array(instance.exports.mem.buffer, ptr, len);&#10;      console.log(new TextDecoder().decode(bytes));&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;const { instance } = await WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming(fetch(&#39;app.wasm&#39;), importObject);&#10;instance.exports.run(); // 调用模块导出\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> importObject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  env: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 把宿主能力以导入函数注入模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ptr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bytes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Uint8Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(instance.exports.mem.buffer, ptr, len);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDecoder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">decode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(bytes));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">instance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> WebAssembly.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">instantiateStreaming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'app.wasm'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), importObject);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">instance.exports.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 调用模块导出</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>log</code> 收到的是 <code>(ptr, len)</code> 而非字符串——这正印证了边界只能传标量：模块把字符串字节写进 <a href=\"../wasm-foundations/wat-module-structure\">文本格式 WAT 与模块结构</a> 里声明并导出的那块 <code>mem</code>，再把偏移与长度作为标量传出，JS 这边从 <code>buffer</code> 里按 <code>(ptr, len)</code> 切片解码。手写这套编解码繁琐且易错，因此实践中由 <a href=\"../compiling-to-wasm/rust-cpp-toolchains\">Rust 与 C++ 工具链</a> 中的 <code>wasm-bindgen</code>（Rust）或 Emscripten 的胶水自动生成——你写 <code>fn greet(name: &amp;str) -&gt; String</code>，工具替你生成两侧的内存读写代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"引用类型与零拷贝\">引用类型与零拷贝</h2><p>让边界更高效的关键武器是<strong>引用类型</strong>与<strong>共享内存视图</strong>。<code>externref</code>（<a href=\"../wasm-foundations/linear-memory-types\">线性内存与类型系统</a> 中介绍）让模块持有一个对 JS 对象的不透明句柄而无需把对象序列化进线性内存——例如把一个 DOM 节点的句柄传进 Wasm，模块保存它、之后调回宿主操作它，全程只传一个引用，避免了昂贵的序列化。</p>\n<p>对大块二进制数据，<strong>零拷贝</strong>尤其重要。JS 的 <code>TypedArray</code> 可以直接以 Wasm 的线性内存 <code>buffer</code> 为底层存储构造视图，于是图像像素、音频样本、网络数据包能被 Wasm 与 JS 共享同一段字节，无需来回拷贝。这对 <a href=\"../applications-ecosystem/in-browser-compute\">浏览器内高性能计算</a> 中的编解码、图像处理是性能命脉。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  BUF[&quot;Wasm 线性内存 buffer&quot;] --&gt; V1[&quot;JS Uint8Array 视图 (零拷贝)&quot;]&#10;  BUF --&gt; V2[&quot;Wasm 内部直接读写&quot;]&#10;  V1 --&gt; SHARE[&quot;同一段字节, 两侧共享&quot;]&#10;  V2 --&gt; SHARE\">graph TD\n  BUF[\"Wasm 线性内存 buffer\"] --&gt; V1[\"JS Uint8Array 视图 (零拷贝)\"]\n  BUF --&gt; V2[\"Wasm 内部直接读写\"]\n  V1 --&gt; SHARE[\"同一段字节, 两侧共享\"]\n  V2 --&gt; SHARE</pre><p>需要警惕的是：当 <code>memory.grow</code> 触发线性内存重新分配时，旧的 <code>buffer</code> 会被分离（detached），此前构造的 TypedArray 视图随即失效——必须在增长后重新构造视图，这是 Wasm 互操作里一个常见的 bug 来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界开销与原生宿主互操作\">边界开销与原生宿主互操作</h2><p>跨 Wasm↔宿主边界并非免费。每次调用有固定的调度开销，每次传字符串/数组有编解码与可能的拷贝成本。可以粗略建模为：一次跨边界调用的成本约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>call</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>byte</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = C_{\\text{call}} + n \\cdot C_{\\text{byte}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">call</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">byte</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>call</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{call}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">call</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是固定调用开销、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是传输字节数。结论很直接——<strong>少跨边界、每次多传</strong>：把热点循环整体放进 Wasm，而非在循环内频繁回调 JS。这也是 <a href=\"../compiling-to-wasm/high-level-language-challenges\">高级语言编译的挑战</a> 中「最后一公里摩擦」的量化版本。</p>\n<p>在非浏览器场景，宿主是 <a href=\"runtimes-jit\">Wasm 运行时与即时编译</a> 里的嵌入式运行时（Wasmtime、WAMR 等），互操作通过运行时的嵌入 API 完成：宿主用 C/Rust/Go 注册「host function」供模块导入，并能直接读写模块的线性内存。这套机制是「应用内插件系统」的基础——数据库或代理把自己的 API 以 host function 暴露给用户上传的 Wasm 扩展。当多个 Wasm 组件之间互操作时，点对点绑定会失控，业界转向用 WIT 描述接口的统一方案，完整展开见 <a href=\"../applications-ecosystem/component-model-future\">组件模型与未来</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>互操作的核心难题是跨越类型与内存鸿沟：Wasm 只认标量与引用，宿主满是对象、字符串、数组。</li>\n<li>浏览器/Node 通过标准 <code>WebAssembly</code> JS API 实例化与调用，复杂数据靠「写线性内存 + 传指针长度」，由 wasm-bindgen/Emscripten 自动生成编解码。</li>\n<li>引用类型（externref）以不透明句柄传宿主对象避免序列化；TypedArray 共享线性内存 buffer 实现大块数据零拷贝。</li>\n<li>警惕 memory.grow 后 buffer 分离导致旧 TypedArray 视图失效——必须重建视图。</li>\n<li>跨边界有成本（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>call</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>byte</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{call}} + n \\cdot C_{\\text{byte}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">call</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">byte</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），原则是少跨多传；原生宿主用 host function 嵌入 API 互操作，多组件场景转向 WIT。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"主机绑定与互操作","id":"主机绑定与互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"JavaScript 互操作：WebAssembly API","id":"javascript-互操作-webassembly-api"},{"level":2,"text":"引用类型与零拷贝","id":"引用类型与零拷贝"},{"level":2,"text":"边界开销与原生宿主互操作","id":"边界开销与原生宿主互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"WASI 系统接口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/runtime-execution/wasi-system-interface"},"next":{"title":"浏览器内高性能计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/webassembly-compilation/applications-ecosystem/in-browser-compute"}}